    {
      "name": "dsh-code-diff-review",
      "title": {
        "en": "Code Change Review",
        "zh": "代码修改审查"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Open a side-by-side version-comparison window inside DSH: changed files and git history on the left, a two-pane diff in the middle, and a short per-hunk review note on hover (scope, what changed, risk, evidence). Generates a whole-change natural-language review and a logic relationship graph with AI.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 里打开版本对比窗口：左侧是改动清单与 git 记录，中间是左右分栏 diff，鼠标悬浮任意改动块会弹出这一小段的审查说明（范围 / 改了什么 / 风险 / 依据）；右栏还能用 AI 生成整份自然语言审查和逻辑关系图。"
      },
      "author": "MrLukezy",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/MrLukezy/dsh-code-review",
